            "notes": "[Gotta Have Faith](item_b1c30cfc-b920-4d1e-91f3-98c16ca0c3d7) depending on your team this is amazing and can enable dps to be supported in the enemy backlines so if you have repear, genji or even some flanking 76 this will enable the hell out of them without you needing to take as much risk.\n\n [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) is another strong choice but it's not as needed in this build as the choices we make mean we shouldn't need more survivability BUT teams can harddive you and picking this can be a counter that so.\n\nLastly, [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf) this is a must pick the 15% weapon damage will allow you to be more a threat and 15% AP works with the build not only that the showing targets through walls enables people to chase down targets or tell them where they're going. Situationally,  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) can be better to counter high heal  teams.\n\nUpdate:  [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44)  +  [Hiking Hoverboots](item_158611dd-147a-4375-a16a-565aa4f5f7de)  is an amazing escape/mobility tool as a another option instead. Found this insane when being pressured by Reapers.",
